WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:06.880
First, many people and AI agents write at once, and a named check admits changes or records why.

2
00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:14.874
Second, tracking name-free functions instead of text lines lets unrelated edits pass together without false merge wars.

3
00:00:15.214 --> 00:00:21.988
Third, developers stay on ordinary Git while checking against one hundred thousand items takes seventy microseconds.
